{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/arthouse-residences-cledor-al-marjan-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":4,"crm_id":"5154","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":" Arthouse Residences","slug":"arthouse-residences-cledor-al-marjan-island","display_address":"Al Marjan Island","building_type":["apartment","duplex","suites"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Clédor","price":925000,"display_price":"925k","lattitude":25.0374773,"longitude":55.1316832,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":1,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Discover a new realm of luxury living at Arthouse Residences, located on the serene shores of Al Marjan Island in Ras Al Khaimah. Clédor brings the first-ever Arthouse-branded residences outside the U.S. to the UAE, setting a new benchmark in curated luxury living. Arthouse Residences by Clédor presents a boutique selection of <strong>studio, 1-bedroom apartments, and 1-bedroom duplexes</strong>—each defined by striking architecture and thoughtful design.</p><p>These branded residences provide direct beach access and are located just minutes from the world-class Wynn Resort, placing luxury and entertainment at your doorstep. Residents enjoy a rooftop adults-only infinity pool with a sunken bar, a private beach club, and the signature ambiance of a cigar lounge. With only a 10% down payment, the property offers exceptional access to an exclusive lifestyle in one of the UAE’s most promising beachfront communities.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Arthouse_Residences_on_Al_Marjan_Island_by_Cledor_64f00b0041.jpg","hash":"Arthouse_Residences_on_Al_Marjan_Island_by_Cledor_64f00b0041","name":"Arthouse Residences on Al Marjan Island by Clédor"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Arthouse_Residence